---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Chameleon Help Desk" description="About this unofficial MECCHA CHAMELEON help site MVP and its evidence rules.">
  <section class="shell section">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>A cautious help site for a fast-moving game.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Chameleon Help Desk is an unofficial MVP for organizing MECCHA CHAMELEON community questions, safe checks, and update notes.
    </p>
    <div class="status-strip">
      <div>
        <h3>What it does</h3>
        <p>Collects public player questions and turns them into readable help pages.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>What it avoids</h3>
        <p>No fake testing claims, no copied official branding, no unsafe bypass instructions.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Best next step</h3>
        <p>Replace placeholder sources with a real question table from Steam, Reddit, and update comments.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Future upgrade</h3>
        <p>Add personally tested guides only after screenshots and test records exist.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
